---
title: "Trump Rejects Iran Peace Terms"
date: "2026-03-15T01:51:00Z"
source: "Deutsche Welle"
sourceUrl: "https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-trump-says-peace-deal-terms-not-good-enough-yet/live-76363921?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-rdf"
category: "politics"
---

The US president rejected peace terms as "not good enough." Donald Trump offered no conditions 2 weeks into the war, adding the US "may hit Kharg a few more times just for fun." Iranian officials warned of strikes on US companies in the Gulf if Washington targeted Iran's energy infrastructure.
